Write wasmJsMain storage implementation for the `client` KMP module of a book reading leaderboard app.

## Project root: `/Users/se/git/cc-experiments`

## Contracts from commonMain (already defined, DO NOT modify):

```kotlin
// com.bookreads.storage.AppPreferences (commonMain)
@Serializable
data class AppPreferences(
    val username: String? = null,
    val activeSession: ActiveSession? = null,
)

@Serializable
data class ActiveSession(val clientId: String, val bookTitle: String, val startedAt: String, val elapsedSec: Long)

// com.bookreads.storage.LocalStorageService (commonMain)
interface LocalStorageService {
    fun getUsername(): Flow<String?>
    suspend fun setUsername(username: String?)
    fun getActiveSession(): Flow<ActiveSession?>
    suspend fun saveActiveSession(session: ActiveSession)
    suspend fun clearActiveSession()
}

// com.bookreads.di.ClientModule (commonMain)
expect val clientPlatformModule: Module
```

## Files to create

### 1. `client/src/wasmJsMain/kotlin/com/bookreads/storage/PrefServiceLocalStorage.kt`

Use `kotlinx.browser.localStorage` (from kotlin stdlib for wasm/js targets) to persist `AppPreferences` as JSON. Use a `MutableStateFlow<AppPreferences>` to serve the `Flow` APIs.

```kotlin
package com.bookreads.storage

import kotlinx.browser.localStorage
import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.Flow
import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.MutableStateFlow
import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.map
import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.update
import kotlinx.serialization.json.Json

private const val PREFS_KEY = "bookreads_prefs"

internal class PrefServiceLocalStorage : LocalStorageService {
    private val json = Json { ignoreUnknownKeys = true }
    private val prefsFlow = MutableStateFlow(load())

    private fun load(): AppPreferences {
        val raw = localStorage.getItem(PREFS_KEY) ?: return AppPreferences()
        return try {
            json.decodeFromString(AppPreferences.serializer(), raw)
        } catch (_: Throwable) {
            AppPreferences()
        }
    }

    private fun save(prefs: AppPreferences) {
        localStorage.setItem(PREFS_KEY, json.encodeToString(AppPreferences.serializer(), prefs))
    }

    override fun getUsername(): Flow<String?> = prefsFlow.map { it.username }

    override suspend fun setUsername(username: String?) {
        prefsFlow.update { it.copy(username = username) }
        save(prefsFlow.value)
    }

    override fun getActiveSession(): Flow<ActiveSession?> = prefsFlow.map { it.activeSession }

    override suspend fun saveActiveSession(session: ActiveSession) {
        prefsFlow.update { it.copy(activeSession = session) }
        save(prefsFlow.value)
    }

    override suspend fun clearActiveSession() {
        prefsFlow.update { it.copy(activeSession = null) }
        save(prefsFlow.value)
    }
}
```

### 2. `client/src/wasmJsMain/kotlin/com/bookreads/di/ClientWebModule.kt`

```kotlin
package com.bookreads.di

import com.bookreads.storage.LocalStorageService
import com.bookreads.storage.PrefServiceLocalStorage
import org.koin.core.module.Module
import org.koin.dsl.module

actual val clientPlatformModule: Module = module {
    single<LocalStorageService> { PrefServiceLocalStorage() }
}
```

Write both files exactly as specified. No extra files, no comments.

